#: kcm.cpp:78
msgid ""
"Unable to save settings because a temporary directory could not be created."
msgstr ""
"Nastavitev ni mogoče shraniti, ker ni bilo mogoče ustvariti začasnega "
"imenika."

#: kcm.cpp:139
msgid "Unable to save settings because the config could not be opened."
msgstr ""
"Nastavitev ni mogoče shraniti, ker konfiguracije ni bilo mogoče odpreti."

#: kcm.cpp:214
msgid ""
"Unable to synchronise Plasma settings because the 'plasmalogin' user does "
"not exist. Please check your Plasma Login install."
msgstr ""
"Nastavitev Plasme ni mogoče sinhronizirati, ker uporabnik 'plasmalogin' ne "
"obstaja. Preverite namestitev prijave v Plasmo."

#: kcm.cpp:269
msgid ""
"Unable to reset Plasma settings because the 'plasmalogin' user does not "
"exist. Please check your Plasma Login install."
msgstr ""
"Nastavitev Plasme ni mogoče ponastaviti, ker uporabnik 'plasmalogin' ne "
"obstaja. Preverite namestitev prijave v Plasmo."

